{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.DilogPartBWP1Refutation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.DilogPartBWP1Refutation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Exponential","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Deriv"],"declarations":28,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.not_tendsto_boundary_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.not_tendsto_boundary_zero","kind":"theorem","line":323,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L323-L334","doc":"**Refutation of the unconditional joint boundary limit (scope-(b)).**  The limit\n`(q−1)·log(1−x·qⁿ) → 0` is FALSE: along the explicit counter-sequence `q_m`, the boundary\nterm converges to `log x ≠ 0` (`tendsto_boundary_refute`), so by uniqueness of limits it\ndoes not converge to `0`.  This proves the Diophantine no-resonance hypothesis of\n`tendsto_wp1_sum_of_no_resonance` (#4270) is **necessary**. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_boundary_refute","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_boundary_refute","kind":"theorem","line":306,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L306-L321","doc":"**Crux.**  Along the counter-sequence `q_m`, the boundary term converges to `log x`:\n\n`(q_m − 1)·log(1 − x·q_m^m)  ⟶  log x`.\n\nFactor `= [m·(q_m−1)]·[log(1−x q_m^m)/m] → L·(−1) = −L = log x`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_B","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_B","kind":"theorem","line":282,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L282-L304","doc":"**(B)** `log(1 − x·q_m^m)/m → −1`.  Squeeze `(log β_m − β_m)/m ≤ log δ_m/m ≤ log β_m/m`\n(from `logDelta_lower`/`logDelta_upper`, divided by `m>0`), both ends `→ −1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.logDelta_upper","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.logDelta_upper","kind":"theorem","line":267,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L267-L280","doc":"Per-step log upper bound `log δ_m ≤ log β_m` (from `1 − e^{−β} ≤ β`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.logDelta_lower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.logDelta_lower","kind":"theorem","line":244,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L244-L265","doc":"Per-step log lower bound `log β_m − β_m ≤ log δ_m` (from `β e^{−β} ≤ 1 − e^{−β}`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_log_wpRefBeta_div_m","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_log_wpRefBeta_div_m","kind":"theorem","line":225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L225-L242","doc":"`log β_m/m → −1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_log_denom_div_m","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_log_denom_div_m","kind":"theorem","line":211,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L211-L223","doc":"`log(m+e^{−m})/m → 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_denom_div_m","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_denom_div_m","kind":"theorem","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L193-L209","doc":"`(m+e^{−m})/m → 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_log_div_self_atTop","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_log_div_self_atTop","kind":"theorem","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L188-L191","doc":"`log y / y → 0` at atTop. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.log_wpRefBeta_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.log_wpRefBeta_eq","kind":"theorem","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L176-L186","doc":"`log β_m = log L − m − log(m+e^{−m})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_A","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L150-L174","doc":"**(A)** `m·(q_m − 1) → L`.  Squeeze `m·t_m ≤ m·(q_m−1) ≤ m·t_m·q_m` from\n`t ≤ eᵗ − 1 ≤ t·eᵗ` (both from `Real.add_one_le_exp`), both ends `→ L`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_m_mul_wpRefT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_m_mul_wpRefT","kind":"theorem","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L142-L148","doc":"`m·t_m → L`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.m_mul_wpRefT_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.m_mul_wpRefT_eq","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L134-L140","doc":"Algebraic identity `m·t_m = L − β_m`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.endpoint_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.endpoint_eq","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L119-L132","doc":"**Endpoint identity** `x·q_m^m = exp(−β_m)`.  Pure algebra: `q_m^m = exp(m·t_m)`,\n`x = exp(log x) = exp(−L)`, and `−L + m·t_m = −β_m`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_wpRefBeta_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_wpRefBeta_zero","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L104-L117","doc":"`β_m → 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_qSeq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_qSeq_one","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L98-L102","doc":"`q_m → 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_wpRefT_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_wpRefT_zero","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L93-L96","doc":"`t_m → 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.wpRef_denom_atTop","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.wpRef_denom_atTop","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L87-L91","doc":"The denominator `m + e^{−m} → ∞`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.one_lt_qSeq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.one_lt_qSeq","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L81-L85","doc":"**`1 < q_m`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.wpRefBeta_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.wpRefBeta_pos","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L76-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.wpRefT_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.wpRefT_pos","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L73-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.wpRef_denom_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.wpRef_denom_pos","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L70-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.log_eq_neg_wpRefL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.log_eq_neg_wpRefL","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L65-L68","doc":"`log x = − L`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.wpRefL_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.wpRefL_pos","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L61-L63","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.wpRefBeta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.wpRefBeta","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L57-L59","doc":"The endpoint gap exponent `β_m := L·e^{−m}/(m+e^{−m})`, so `x·q_m^m = exp(−β_m)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qSeq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qSeq","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L54-L55","doc":"The counter-sequence `q_m := exp(t_m)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.wpRefT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.wpRefT","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L51-L52","doc":"The resonant width exponent `t_m := L / (m + e^{−m})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.wpRefL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.wpRefL","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBWP1Refutation.lean#L48-L49","doc":"`L := log(1/x)`, positive for `x ∈ (0,1)`.  Target boundary value is `−L = log x`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}